# Timed test of camera movement.
# Format: <seconds> <command> [args]
0.5  screenshot /tmp/m_t0_start.png
1.0  down w
3.0  up w
3.5  screenshot /tmp/m_t1_after_forward.png
4.0  down right
5.5  up right
6.0  screenshot /tmp/m_t2_after_turn.png
6.5  down up
7.5  up up
8.0  screenshot /tmp/m_t3_after_pitch.png
8.5  quit
